    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515-a1">

                <pb facs="0965" n="841" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg841"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Morales to
                        Señor de Zamacona.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tucson, Ariz.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi>
                        12</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Outrages continue. Yesterday cow-boys attacked Mexicans at Ochoville. One
                    wounded; one horse killed and all they possessed stolen.</p>
                <closer><signed>V. MORALES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
